# isonim-docs — task entry points (mirrors ../isonim/Justfile's style).
#
# Every recipe assumes the IsoNim dev shell is active (Nim, nimble, just
# all come from there -- there is no global nim). From a clean checkout:
#   nix develop ../isonim -c just ci-docs

